<title>MEXICO: GFBancrecer nine mth loss widens.</title>
<headline>GFBancrecer nine mth loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican financial company Grupo Financiero Bancrecer said its 9-month net loss widened to 142.9 million pesos from a loss of 55.9 million pesos recorded in the first nine months of 1995.</p>
<p>Bancrecer said the loss was due to reserve building in its banking subsidiaries which amounted to 326.9 million pesos, without which, the group would have reported a net profit of 212 million pesos.</p>
<p>    9-mo Results	    1996			  1995</p>
<p>    Incomes		 779.9 million		   183.6 million</p>
<p>    Expenditures	  401.8 million		    67.0 million</p>
<p>    Operating Profit    378.1 million		   116.6 million</p>
<p>    Net Loss		142.9 million		    55.9 million</p>
<p>--Mexico City newsroom +525 7287902</p>
